WEBVTT

00:00:03.191 --> 00:00:08.256
The live dashboard and the shared voicemail show only the queues and campaigns

00:00:08.256 --> 00:00:12.355
on your own agent entitlement record, even for administrators.

00:00:12.355 --> 00:00:17.661
Here the dashboard is empty, because this administrator has no entitlement record.

00:00:18.114 --> 00:00:21.411
The same rule applies in the Work tab of the soft phone.

00:00:21.411 --> 00:00:25.187
You sign in only to the queues and campaigns you are entitled to,

00:00:25.187 --> 00:00:29.654
so when one is missing, ask your manager to add it to your entitlement record.

00:00:31.254 --> 00:00:34.135
An empty activity list is often a filter.

00:00:34.135 --> 00:00:39.468
Activities lists only manual activities assigned to you that are not started yet,

00:00:39.468 --> 00:00:44.434
so unassigned dialer work and automated AI activities are not listed there.

00:00:45.184 --> 00:00:49.558
An empty report is usually the date range, which starts on today.

00:00:49.558 --> 00:00:54.486
Pick a longer range, clear the queue, agent or campaign filters, and check

00:00:54.486 --> 00:00:56.704
that you may view the reports.

